<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Thailand Financials basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Thailand Financials basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 100,000 American-style call warrants, on a Thailand Financials basket comprising Bangkok Bank Plc, Thai Farmers Bank Plc, Bank of Ayudhya Plc, Thai Military Bank Plc, First Bangkok City Bank Plc, Siam Commercial Bank Plc, Finance One Plc, National Finance and Securities Co Ltd, Securities One Ltd, CMIC Finance and Securities Co Ltd and General Finance and Securities Co Ltd, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one of the underlying.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    $500.00		   PREMIUM	19.50 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $91.50		    GEARING	5.40 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	07.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  $498.96</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
